<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-INDIA 210 ALL OUT AT CLOSE V BARBADOS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 210 ALL OUT AT CLOSE V BARBADOS.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN, Barbados 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 210 all out at the close of play on the first day of their three-day match against Barbados on Saturday.</p>
</text>
